WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Twelve minutes can be a practical start.
But a clock is not a clinical study.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
An experiment showed that a moving mouth can affect
what some people report hearing. Not proof about a meditation recording.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Zen12 Premium is sold as twelve levels containing 48 MP3 recordings
and four styles, according to its seller.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Package features are not evidence that twelve minutes equals an hour,
or that a recording treats a condition.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try the free practice. Review the features and uncertainties.
Decide whether a paid structure genuinely fits your routine.
